From: CB1 contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve decoded HDR10+ identity and derive Dolby Vision statistics

Use complete source statistics without redundant image analysis. Keep native
admission, accepted-scene ownership and existing AI support for sparse sources.

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

